{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cde940670772fd464a417d12ee924585de002b547d5a28ea81557091246ff824", "ja": "（昨日の雪まつりのステージは、歩のダンスが\n大いに会場を盛り上げ、成功をおさめた）", "zh": "（在昨天雪祭的表演中，\n步的舞蹈大大炒热了会场气氛，让活动以成功告终。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1001_p", "source_sha256": "376ab16384b51636cb927a3f5b46e08e4200a2e49e93084e4d9fed6fd909ada7", "ja": "（一夜明けて、これから劇場に戻る予定なのだが、\n集合時間の間際になっても歩の姿が見えない……）", "zh": "（但在一夜过去，我们准备要回剧场的时候，\n步却直到集合时间逼近还不见踪影……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e887613071af0e64a920fb4ead90a00ed4ed3e898239d6eef1ff1e353856a15d", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……ま、間に合ったー！\n{$P$}、遅れてゴメン！", "zh": "呼、呼……赶、赶上了──！\n{$P$}，抱歉，我迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "10dab73351ca8386a3316fafe783d658f5e8303b1add9c57f00f06607e8d958c", "ja": "目覚ましにスマホのアラーム設定してたんだけど、\n充電が切れちゃっててさ……。", "zh": "我有用手机设闹钟，\n结果早上却没电了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6cfc148014bb82136397fd58b10c3761211ea28927ea2fb110aa298302e1ccae", "ja": "慌てて飛び起きて出る準備してたら、\n今度はスーツケースのカギが壊れるし……！", "zh": "我连忙跳下床准备出门，\n但接着又换行李箱的锁坏掉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b22d5fd9322c691912dade47eb1558b563a10d1da316890a5b614e400af41453", "ja": "そ、そうか……\n何はともあれ、無事に来てくれてよかった。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n无论如何，幸好你平安赶来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "88644ce31dc8a61d1fb8334e9c29e6bd6e647d5e58e17aad4fb2e7418b42a041", "ja": "昨日のステージの後だからな。\n疲れて、寝てるのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "昨天才刚表演完，\n我还以为你累得睡到现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b7310722437b854d7540e3606958451fe74562d4a71db636820dadca60efa757", "ja": "それはないって！　本番だからって、\n無茶なコトとかしてないし……。", "zh": "不可能啦！就算是正式演出，\n我也不会勉强自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "70e6e069486def7d98f7ec1850fe643889bada68ae99b9c2c64d4a1f51459a17", "ja": "あ、でもちょっとハリキリすぎたかな？\n久しぶりに筋肉痛かも。へへっ！", "zh": "啊，不过好像跳得有点太热情？\n我好久没肌肉酸痛了呢，嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3dbcdeb31e55c9d55408078783147d26cffc25d468723329c35fe9aa2e111477", "ja": "あれだけ激しいダンスをして、\n筋肉痛で済むんだから大したものだよ。", "zh": "跳完那么激烈的舞蹈，\n隔天只有肌肉酸痛已经很厉害啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc7eca2bb44aaf6b276246fabac57334451523b5e1ef498fef35b3e37261741f", "ja": "踊ってる最中は、もう夢中になっちゃってるからさ！\n自分が疲れてるかどうか、わからないんだよね。", "zh": "因为我跳舞的时候，真的很专注啊！\n所以不知道自己到底累不累。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df06072f0180fb6c62ed15fb534ae0f3f28242c23485f588788ccdb851b546e8", "ja": "それに、みんなでかまくらを作って、\n鍋したりして。すっごく、楽しかったからさ～！", "zh": "而且，大家一起做雪屋、煮火锅，\n真的好开心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "af6cd46a26accdc52aefefafaa2f8636ea255b717ec234abf03a193eea784d88", "ja": "終わって、ホテルに戻ったとたん\n「あ、眠い……」ってなっちゃって……。", "zh": "只是结束后一回到旅馆，\n我就突然觉得「啊，好想睡……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1013_p", "source_sha256": "70f846684cb9dd789ad5b45cee46eea79357d39a87faf4cd30ed74a532f87810", "ja": "そのままベッドに倒れ込んだ、という訳か。", "zh": "于是就这么倒在床上睡着了，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93bc5fd0207f1cf66b443b6ae5f1d4f374680211fef912fcfc0910616c13073e", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　目が覚めたら、もう朝でさ。\n目覚ましは止まってるし、「マイガー！？」って！", "zh": "就是啊！一觉醒来已经是早上，\n手机闹钟也没响，真的是「My God！？」耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "427d4b3fbeb3f5cbcefcedc3dfff5a33375f7aec1803dbf95531630c8c766f98", "ja": "ははは。ステージ上のキリッとした歩からは、\nなんだか想像つかない姿だな。", "zh": "哈哈哈，步在舞台上那么帅气，\n实在想像不到私底下会有这一面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2aafacb04f6a8a0fae41d440014f04e083d172ac5a77dbe7dcfa5cbd8cf99140", "ja": "そ、そこは……ほら、メリハリってやつだよ！\nオンとオフは、きっちりわけないとって。", "zh": "那、那是因为……对了，要有起伏嘛！\n公私要分明才行啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6ebf1ffebad9350a3fd0acf4b60839ecca6efa525d7b4f080ae91673158e7a63", "ja": "普段ちょっとくらいかっこ悪くても、ステージに\n立ったら、誰よりもかっこよく踊ってみせるからさ！", "zh": "就算我平时有点少根筋，但只要一站上舞台，\n就会跳得比谁都还要帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4a7f53086ee328abf3058b618e1d6f3051c9eecc00ca7c18592917a584364d9b", "ja": "なるほど。確かに昨日のステージの歩は、\n間違いなく、誰よりもかっこよかったぞ！", "zh": "原来如此。也是，步在昨天的舞台上，\n的确比任何人都还要帅气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "623df47e81c7e37215b3d532c309148764b5e4397a8419aaacd07580c9c60528", "ja": "へへっ、だよね！\nサンキュー、{$P$}♪", "zh": "嘿嘿！没错吧！\n谢啦，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7beefa9faf98a5dc1cef59ac91056e49011335f9f8a5e027340797c236f35dac", "ja": "さて、話が済んだところで……空港に急ごう！\n筋肉痛のところ悪いが、出発時刻ギリギリだ。走れ！", "zh": "好啦，既然聊得差不多……我们快去机场吧！\n我知道你肌肉酸痛，但真的快赶不上飞机了。跑起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0093_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0475b6370c531dfb85ed1f9ccf199837ba5be9f847011c6baa7f0715af984ed4", "ja": "えっ？　……マイガー！　もうこんな時間だ！\n{$P$}、ごめーんっ！", "zh": "咦……My God！已经这么晚了！\n{$P$}，对不起啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
